        "text": "**DESTROY THE DAEMONIC**\n\nEach time an **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO MALLEUS** model from your army makes an attack, re‐roll a Hit roll of 1 and, if the target of that attack is a **DAEMON** unit, re‐roll a Wound roll of 1 as well.",
