        "stats": {
          "Points": {
            "value": 25
          }
        },
        "text": "**WATCH MASTER** model only. At the start of your opponent’s Shooting phase, select one enemy **VEHICLE** unit (excluding **TITANIC** units) within 12\" of and visible to the bearer. That unit must take a Leadership test. If that test is passed, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll; if that test is failed, that unit is not eligible to shoot this phase."
      },
