      "Stratagem§Adaptive Tactics": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DEATHWATCH** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select the Furor Tactics, Malleus Tactics or Purgatus Tactics. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Deathwatch Mission Tactic is active for your unit instead of any other Deathwatch Mission Tactic that is active for your army, even if you have already selected that Deathwatch Mission Tactic this battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Armour of Contempt": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DEATHWATCH** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blind Grenades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit has declared a charge.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM GRENADES** or **VINDICARE ASSASSIN** unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge and is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, subtract 1 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit, or, if your unit is a **VINDICARE ASSASSIN**, subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for that enemy unit instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Close-quarters Barrage": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **VOIDFARERS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a ranged attack that targets a unit within 12\", improve the Strength and Armour Penetration characteristics of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Dispense Justice": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Hereticus, Purgation Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Displacer Field": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM CHARACTER** unit from your army (excluding **OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM** units) that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save and, after the attacking unit has resolved its attacks, unless your unit is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6\" (when doing so, models in this unit move as if they have the **FLY** keyword)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Dragonfire Rounds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DEATHWATCH INFANTRY** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[ASSAULT]** and **[IGNORES COVER]** abilities.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select any units that have already been targeted with either the Kraken Rounds or Hellfire Rounds Stratagems this phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Emperor's Will": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Advanced or Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ensnaring Trap": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM INFANTRY** unit from your army that is within 6\" of one or more enemy units and would be eligible to declare a charge against one or more of those enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can declare a charge. When doing so, you must select one or more of those enemy units as the targets of that charge. In addition, if it is a **CALLIDUS ASSASSIN** unit and it makes a Charge move as a result of this Stratagem, until the end of the turn, each time a model in your unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Wound roll"
      },
      "Stratagem§Exact Punishment": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Hereticus, Purgation Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit from your army is destroyed as the result of an enemy unit’s attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS** unit from your army that was within 6\" of the destroyed unit (you cannot target the destroyed unit with the Stratagem).\n\n**EFFECT:** After the attacking unit has shot, your unit can shoot as if it were your Shooting phase, but when resolving those attacks it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Execution Order": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Hereticus, Purgation Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS INFANTRY** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy **CHARACTER** unit on the battlefield. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in your unit targets that **CHARACTER** unit, its weapons have the **[PRECISION]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hellfire Rounds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DEATHWATCH INFANTRY** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons (excluding Devastating Wounds weapons) equipped by models in your unit have the **[ANTI‐INFANTRY 2+]** and **[ANTI‐MONSTER 5+]** abilities.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select any units that have already been targeted with either the Kraken Rounds or Dragonfire Rounds Stratagems this phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hexagrammic Wards": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Malleus, Daemon Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ORDO MALLEUS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, all Psychic weapons equipped by models in the attacking unit have the **[HAZARDOUS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hyperstimms": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM CHARACTER** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Toughness characteristic of models in your unit. In addition, if it is an **EVERSOR ASSASSIN** unit, until the end of the phase, it has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability.",
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Inviolate Jurisdiction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Hereticus, Purgation Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS INFANTRY** unit from your army within range of an objective marker and that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Kraken Rounds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **DEATHWATCH INFANTRY** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1 and improve the Range characteristic of those weapons by 6\".\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select any units that have already been targeted with either the Dragonfire Rounds or Hellfire Rounds Stratagems this phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Line of Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Hereticus, Purgation Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit can target enemy units that are within Engagement Range of one or more friendly units with ranged weapons (excluding Blast weapons), provided the target is within 12\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Masters of the Void": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **VOIDFARERS CHARACTER** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit from your army that is arriving from Strategic Reserves this turn can be set up within your opponent’s deployment zone (all other restrictions still apply)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Orbital Oversight": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM INFANTRY** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit can only be selected as the target of a ranged attack if the attacking model is within 18\", or, if your unit has the Lone Operative ability, if the attacking model is within 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Prime Target": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets a **CHARACTER** unit, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If that attack is made by an **OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM** model and it targets the enemy **WARLORD**, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Psybolt Ammunition": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Malleus, Daemon Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[LETHAL HITS]** and **[PSYCHIC]** abilities."
      },
      "Stratagem§Rapid Tactical Relocation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **INQUISTOR** or **DEATHWATCH INFANTRY** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield. In the Reinforcements step of your next Movement phase, set your unit up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8\" horizontally away from all enemy models.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select a unit that is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
