            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO MALLEUS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy **DAEMON** unit within 12\" and visible to your unit. That unit must take a Battle‐shock test. If that test is failed, then until the end of the phase, each time a friendly **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit makes an attack that targets that **DAEMON** unit, that attack has the **[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Ritual of Warding": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Malleus, Daemon Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of any Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO MALLEUS** unit from your army that is within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT:** That objective marker is said to be Warded and remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn. While an objective marker is Warded and under your control, enemy **DAEMON** units cannot be set up on the battlefield within 6\" of it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Selfless Bodyguard": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** Attached unit that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack with the **[PRECISION]** ability is allocated to a **CHARACTER** model in your unit, if there are one or more Bodyguard models in your unit, roll one D6: on a 2+, that attack is allocated to a Bodyguard model of your choice in your unit instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Steel Heart": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Malleus, Daemon Hunters"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Stun Grenades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Hereticus, Purgation Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of any phase (excluding the Command phase).\n\n**TARGET:** One **ADEPTUS ARBITES**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO HERETICUS GRENADES** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** or **VEHICLES**) within 8\" of and visible to your unit. That enemy unit must take a Battle‐shock test and, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Truesilver Armour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Ordo Malleus, Daemon Hunters"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Violent Acquisition": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Imperialis Fleet"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit within range of an objective marker, that attack has the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**, **[LANCE]** and **[IGNORES COVER]** abilities."
      },
      "Stratagem§Will-Sapping Salvo": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Agents of the Imperium",
            "Veiled Blade Elimination Force"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM INFANTRY** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability. In addition, if it is a **CULEXUS ASSASSIN** unit, until the end of the phase, change the Damage characteristic of ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit to 3."
      },
