        "text": "Each time the bearer is selected to fight, select one of the following abilities to apply to the bearer's melee weapons until the end of the phase: - **[LANCE]** - **[LETHAL HITS]** - **[PRECISION]** - **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**"
      },
      "Crusade Relic§Digital Arsenal": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Artificer Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time the bearer is selected to shoot, after selecting targets for all of its ranged weapons, select one enemy unit targeted by one or more of the bearer's attacks and roll three D6: for each 4+, that unit suffers 1 mortal wound. Mortal wounds inflicted by this Crusade Relic can be allocated as if they had the **[PRECISION]** ability."
      },
      "Requisition§Inquisitorial Mandate": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition when you are selecting Agendas, if your Crusade force contains one or more INQUISITOR models. You can select one additional Agents of the Imperium Agenda to use in that battle. If one or more units from your army gain XP in that battle due to that Agenda, you gain 1 RP."
      },
      "Requisition§Forge Killteam": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition just after you have won a battle, if your Crusade force contains one or more WATCH MASTER models. You may select a second unit to be Marked for Greatness if it has the DEATHWATCH keyword (excluding CHARACTERS)."
      },
      "Requisition§Privateering": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition once per Shadow Operation, if your Order of Battle contains one or more VOIDFARERS CHARACTER models. When purchased, you can do one of the following:\n\nGain either D3 Influence or D3 Intrigue points.\n\nLose 3 Influence and/or Intrigue points (in any combination) and gain D3+1RP."
      },
      "Requisition§Crafted for Battle": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition when you add a RETINUE unit to your Order of Battle, if your Crusade force contains one or more AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM CHARACTER units that have the Battle-hardened rank or higher. That RETINUE unit gains 6 experience points and gains the Blooded rank. Select one Battle Honour for them."
      },
      "Requisition§Investigation Chamber": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "You can purchase this Requisition once per Shadow Operation, just before rolling on the Plot Twists table. Select the result instead of rolling randomly."
      },
      "Crusade Badge§Elite Operative": {
        "text": "You have completed one Shadow Operation (with a final Sub-sector Control of 1 or better).\nOne or more models in your Crusade force have Vermilion-level Assets.\nYou have won two or more battles."
      },
      "Crusade Badge§Champion of the Imperium": {
        "text": "You have halted profane rituals, exposed debased cults and brought stability to entire Imperial systems. Your battles may have cost many lives, but they have preserved vital Imperial infrastructure and institutions. Your star might be veiled amidst the shadows, but it is rising nonetheless.\nYou have completed two or more Shadow Operations (with at least one Shadow Operation having a final Sub-sector Control of 6 or better).\nTwo or more models in your Crusade force have Vermilion-level Assets.\nYou have won six or more battles."
      },
      "Crusade Badge§Hand of the High Lords": {
        "text": "You have completed three or more Shadow Operations (with at least one Shadow Operation having a final Sub-sector Control of 9).\nThree or more models in your Crusade force have Vermilion-level Assets.\nOne model from your Crusade force has acquired the Archeotech Curiosity Crusade Relic.\nYou have won ten or more battles."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Void Trader": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Agents of the Imperium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If the bearer is on the battlefield at the end of the battle, increase your Crusade force's Supply Limit by 50 points. At the end of battle, you can select one model from your Crusade force that has one Crusade Relic or one weapon that has a Weapon Modification. If you do, you can remove that Battle Honour from that model - you can either replace that Battle Honour with a different Crusade Relic that model can have or you can gain 1RP."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Highly Placed Ally": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Agents of the Imperium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If the bearer is your **^^Warlord^^**, start the battle with 1CP. If the bearer is on the battlefield at the end of the battle and you won that battle, roll one D6: on a 4+, you gain 1RP."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Secret Forces": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Agents of the Imperium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "If the bearer is included in a Crusade army whose Army Faction is not **^^Agents of the Imperium^^**, the maximum number of **^^Requisitioned^^**, **^^Retinue^^** and **^^Agents of the Imperium Character^^** units that can be included in that army is increased by 1. Each time you start a Shadow Operation, you start with 1 Influence point."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Trained By A Legend": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Agents of the Imperium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "The bearer's unit has the Lone Operative, Infiltrators and Stealth abilities. Each time you start a Shadow Operation, you start with 1 Intrigue point."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Master of Spies": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Agents of the Imperium"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time you start a Shadow Operation, you start with 1 Investigation point. Each time you roll on the Plot Twist table, you can re-roll the result."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Bound Entity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Radical",
            "notPuritan"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**^^Radical^^** model only. The bearer's unit has the Deep Strike ability. Once per Shadow Operation, when you attempt to Thwart a Threat through Intrigue, you can re-roll that test. If the bearer loses the **^^Radical^^** keyword or gains the **^^Puritan^^** keyword by any means, it immediately loses this Battle Honour."
      },
      "Vermilion-level Asset§Upholder of the Creed": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Vermillion-level Assets"
          ],
          "Tags": [
            "Puritan",
            "notRadical"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**^^Puritan^^** model only. Improve the bearer's Leadership and Wounds characteristics by 1. Once per Shadow Operation when you attempt to Thwart a Threat through Influence, you can re-roll that test. If the bearer loses the **^^Puritan^^** keyword or gains the **^^Radical^^** keyword by any means, it immediately loses this Battle Honour."
      },
