      "Threat§Threat 1": {},
      "Threat§Threat 2": {},
      "Threat§Threat 3": {},
      "Shadow Operation§Shadow Operation": {
        "assets": {
          "traits": [
            "Threat§Threat 1",
            "Threat§Threat 2",
            "Threat§Threat 3"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**Shadow Operations.** With any AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM CHARACTERS in your Crusade force you can run a Shadow Operation: name a sub-sector and set three Threats (choose or roll each Level). Sub-sector Control and all tallies start at 0.\n\n**After each battle** (Update Order of Battle step), if your Crusade army included an AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM CHARACTER: gain 1 Investigation point and allocate it to an active Threat; then you may try to uncover one Threat — roll a D6 and add its Investigation points; equal to or above its Covert Level uncovers it (roll on the matching plot table and set its Plot). Allocate any Influence and Intrigue points from Agendas to uncovered Threats, then you may attempt to Thwart one uncovered Threat: D6 + Intrigue points against its Intrigue goal, else D6 + Influence points against its Influence goal. A Thwarted Threat adds its Threat Score to Sub-sector Control. Then add 1 to the Time tally of every active Threat and roll a Plot Twist; a Threat whose Time tally reaches its Time Remaining is Fulfilled and subtracts its Threat Score from Sub-sector Control.\n\n**Plot Twist (D6):** 1 Plans Within Plans — a random active Threat's Threat Score +1. 2 Escalating Threat — a random active Threat's Time tally +1. 3 Counter-agents — all uncovered Threats' Intrigue goals +1. 4 Fierce Resistance — all uncovered Threats' Influence goals +1. 5 Delaying Action — one active Threat's Time tally −1. 6 A Promising Lead — one active uncovered Threat's Investigation tally +1.\n\n**Cease Shadow Operations** when all three Threats are Thwarted or Fulfilled, and apply the Sub-sector Control result: −9 to −7 Total Collapse (each AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM unit gains a Battle Scar or suffers a Devastating Blow); −6 to −2 Shameful Losses (one CHARACTER gains the Disgraced or Mark of Shame Battle Scar or suffers a Devastating Blow); −1 to 1 Ongoing Unrest (gain 1RP); 2 to 6 Purgation Complete (gain D3RP and one CHARACTER gains a Vermilion-level Asset); 7 to 9 Masterful Execution (gain D6RP and up to two CHARACTERS each gain a Vermilion-level Asset). Then you may start a new Shadow Operation."
      }
    },
    "gameModes": {},
    "theme": {}
  }
}
